<title>UK: DSL Bank adds 100 mln Sfr to Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank adds 100 mln Sfr to Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    21.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.25    PAY DATE  **09.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> NOTES	**PLUS 108 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 150 MLN SFR ON 06.NOV.96</p>
<p>		 INCREASED BY 100 MLN SFR ON 05.DEC.96</p>
<p>		 INCREASED BY 150 MLN SFR ON 22.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
